WEBVTT

00:00:00.827 --> 00:00:02.447
Release day, ten a.m.

00:00:03.032 --> 00:00:05.405
The pipeline is stuck, the
alerts are on, and

00:00:05.405 --> 00:00:07.408
a whole team is waiting
on one deploy.

00:00:10.198 --> 00:00:12.829
I've spent five years making sure
that moment never comes.

00:00:14.149 --> 00:00:17.248
I'm Adrien, a freelance full-stack
and platform engineer

00:00:17.248 --> 00:00:19.627
from Paris, working remotely
across Europe.

00:00:20.029 --> 00:00:22.292
I build the platforms other
engineers ship on,

00:00:22.601 --> 00:00:25.416
so your team ships on time,
and goes home on time.

00:00:26.552 --> 00:00:27.603
No surprises.

00:00:27.603 --> 00:00:28.815
No late nights.

00:00:30.367 --> 00:00:31.804
The proof is in the systems.

00:00:32.572 --> 00:00:35.374
At Thales Alenia Space, I
parallelised satellite

00:00:35.374 --> 00:00:37.592
image compression across
eighty cores.

00:00:37.901 --> 00:00:40.785
At Schneider Electric, in
Boston, I shipped Go and

00:00:40.785 --> 00:00:43.380
Python micro-apps to industrial
edge devices,

00:00:43.506 --> 00:00:45.034
with observability built in.

00:00:45.435 --> 00:00:48.595
Today at Criteo, I build the continuous
deployment platform

00:00:48.595 --> 00:00:51.006
that fifteen hundred engineers
use every day.

00:00:51.866 --> 00:00:56.426
And SignalAtlas is my own product:
I designed, built and run it,

00:00:56.736 --> 00:00:58.447
from first commit to production.

00:01:00.184 --> 00:01:03.067
But code is only half the job.

00:01:03.067 --> 00:01:07.776
I demo every week, write updates
you can forward,

00:01:09.096 --> 00:01:11.634
and leave a runbook your team
can run without me.

00:01:12.036 --> 00:01:13.839
I train and mentor the
engineers around me,

00:01:14.149 --> 00:01:15.401
in English or in French.

00:01:16.262 --> 00:01:18.569
I use AI agents daily,
and I review

00:01:18.569 --> 00:01:20.546
and own every line that ships.

00:01:20.947 --> 00:01:22.843
Tell me about your mission.

00:01:23.244 --> 00:01:26.465
My email and portfolio
are on screen,

00:01:26.465 --> 00:01:28.815
and the first call is free.

